        "slc_602e2f9f9bbdd3619aca12ed199bae39ec2535edbf6986b6dfe649e25ea5cc17"
      ],
      "text": "Plugin backends run as arbitrary local code with the user's filesystem and network authority; worker isolation protects against accidental crashes but is explicitly not a malicious-code sandbox."
    },
